    refinement_prompt = f"""You are a professional banner image editor. You have been given an existing hero banner image.

YOUR ONLY JOB: Apply EXACTLY the changes described in the USER REQUEST below — nothing else.

USER REQUEST:
{feedback}

STRICT RULES — you MUST follow all of these without exception:
1. ONLY change what the user explicitly asked for. Every other element must remain pixel-perfect identical.
2. PRESERVE the exact aspect ratio and canvas dimensions of the original image — do NOT crop, letterbox, or resize.
3. PRESERVE all text — headlines, captions, body copy — exactly as they appear: same wording, same font style, same size, same position, same color, unless the user explicitly asked to change text.
4. PRESERVE the brand logo — same position, same size, same appearance. Never move, resize, recolor, or remove it.
